{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  Snippet: FAQ item (one question with its answer)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
      How long does shipping take?                         (+)   ← summary
        Orders ship within 1–2 business days…                    ← answer (open)
  A <details> element: opens without JavaScript; GSAP (initFaqMain) makes
  the opening smooth. assets/faq.js builds the same markup from the page's
  own text (keep both in sync).

  Parameters:
  - id          {String}  unique id (a link ending in #faq-<id> opens it)
  - question    {String}  plain text
  - answer      {String}  rich text (HTML)
  - attributes  {String}  block.shopify_attributes (theme editor)

  Used in:  sections/faq-main.liquid
  CSS:      assets/faq.css → "3. Topics + questions" (.faq-item*)
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<details class="faq-item" id="faq-{{ id }}" data-faq {{ attributes }}>
  <summary class="faq-item__question">
    <span>{{ question | escape }}</span>
    <span class="faq-item__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </summary>
  <div class="faq-item__answer" data-faq-answer>
    <div class="faq-item__answer-inner">{{ answer }}</div>
  </div>
</details>
